# Portainer inventory

List endpoints, stacks, containers, and images summary. Prefer MCP when
connected (`global-mcp-first`); else Portainer API or authenticated UI.

Never invent endpoint / stack / container ids — list/resolve first. Report
names + state — never paste API tokens or stack env secret values.
